# Hive orchestration state (internal tooling, not product content).
# Repeatedly proven risky to track: harness bookkeeping under agent-complete/
# narrates "what I renamed/removed" and can quote old (pre-scrub) identifiers
# verbatim; broad `git add`/`git add -A` from any agent sweeps it in
# unpredictably. Never re-track any part of .pHive/ in this repo.
.pHive/
.env*
